{"asset_key":"ep8/gameplay_story_18611050","episode":"ep8","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"18611050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1861105001:1":{"text":"既然旧梦糖果最初是由诺珐斯的医师研制的，穆婆婆的修缮屋里说不定会留有相关的配方资料。","source_cn":"既然旧梦糖果最初是由诺珐斯的医师研制的，穆婆婆的修缮屋...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x858A98CF5B22EDD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1861105002:1":{"text":"时隔许久，你再次来到了修缮屋门前。巴登与穆婆婆离开后，这里本该空无一人，但此时屋内却隐隐传来了响动声。","source_cn":"时隔许久，你再次来到了修缮屋门前。巴登与穆婆婆离开后，...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xC61700C066A900B3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"249642","variant_female_record_index":"249643","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1861105003:1":{"text":"你动作谨慎地推开门，却迎面撞上了一道熟悉的视线。","source_cn":"你动作谨慎地推开门，却迎面撞上了一道熟悉的视线。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x77D47926BC799108","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"249644","variant_female_record_index":"249645","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1861105004:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>？<key:keyGender_dialog18>","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x5C6C397B055ED0A1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"249646","variant_female_record_index":"249647","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1861105004":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></